> After a fire damaged this home['s] pool room and caused it to fall into the actual pool, we came in to clean up the aftermath. We[ drained out] the pool and removed all of the debris.
Mold in closet in downstairs bedroom.
[When putting] in a new[ washing] machine[, the] deliver company did not[ turn off the] water[ and] broke[ off the hose] valve. Water[ poured out until the main] water switch was turned off. I need to have a mold inspection done since the[ crawl] space was wet below the utility room.
